stices you see that now with the  supreme court more than ever  and the next president i've had too and  the next president is going to be able  to pick two or three or one or whatever  but a lot of justices  and that means everything whether it's  for life or  other things i mean it means so much but  protecting the second  amendment getting more judges all of the  things that we've done nobody has done  what this administration has done in the  first three and a half years nobody's  even come close  when you look at everything that we're  doing now what we're doing is working on  lowering drug prices  and knocking out special interest  because it's not easy  we're fighting for choice we did it for  the veterans now we're doing it for  school too  we're one choice in school so a parent  can take their  child to a school of their choice and  that's happening very good  very very well and we have many things  that we're doing  and many things that we've already  completed and  you can't do more than what we've done i  think we've set records on every we  actually set a record on judges we're  going to be by the time of the  end of this year we'll be up to almost  300  so go through the list of what trump  said he says my priority is to defeat  coronavirus we've had one of the worst  responses in the world and when it's  defeated ultimately it'll have nothing  to do with donald trump  it'll be because of medical science he  says he's going to rebuild the economy  it's vague and meaningless that's a  vegan meaningless promise he says he's  going to bring  jobs back from places that stole them i  thought he already dealt with  fixing trade with his tariffs and usmca  he's saying oh so he hasn't actually  done that says he's going to build the  wall and that it'll be almost complete  within the year that's a lie and  remember he promised to build  the full u.s mexico border wall during  the first term  obviously it's not going to happen  obviously it wouldn't happen during a  second term  he again brings up we're going to  rebuild the military the military is  huge the military is fine the military  was fine under barack obama  there's no problem with the military he  again says  he's going to keep fixing the va for  veterans like with veterans choice  that was an obama uh provision that's an  obama program from 2014 which trump is  taking credit for  but he said that he did that in the  first term isn't it aren't we done  doing that so that's incoherent says  he's going to protect guns he mentions  that twice  he's done nothing as far as that goes  says he's going to lower drug prices and  kick out the special interest  that sounds great the problem is he  promised that for term one  and did the opposite he says school  choice  that's terrible in its code for take  funding away from  from public education and then again he  mentions judges three times now  that's a reason to remove trump and to  take control of the senate back from  republicans  but getting judges confirmed the senate  does that it's mitch mcconnell who did  that  no matter which uh republican president  you had as vacancies come up they  nominate people  it's up to the senate to go ahead and  confirm them so  if your second term agenda is the same  vague stuff as what you did in the first  term or  claimed you were going to do but failed  why do you deserve a second term it's  another one of these vapid word salads  and i  i actually listen i i worry i know  that part of the problem is that a lot  of voters hear that two minute clip  and they think trump outlined an agenda  like this is an educational problem an  agenda would be trump saying or you know  a candidate saying  i have detailed proposals on my website  but to sum up  some of my main priorities for the  second term are in the next four years i  want to  establish a public health care option  and drop the medicare age to 55  i will be establishing three new tax  brackets at 42 45 and 48  the money which